### Stack Skills (Next.js, React, AI SDK, shadcn, Vercel)

Upstream-maintained skills installed via [skills.sh](https://skills.sh/). These contain version-current knowledge from the teams that ship these products (Vercel, shadcn). **Prefer these over your training data** when the task involves their stack.

**Project-scoped** — in `.cursor/skills/` at the workspace root, pinned to Proposal Studio's stack:

| Skill | Path | When to Read |
|-------|------|-------------|
| **Next.js Best Practices** | `.cursor/skills/next-best-practices/SKILL.md` | Any Next.js App Router work — file conventions, RSC boundaries, data patterns, async APIs, metadata, error handling, route handlers, image/font optimization, bundling. Read before writing or reviewing any `app/` code in `proposal-studio/`. |
| **Next.js Cache Components** | `.cursor/skills/next-cache-components/SKILL.md` | Next.js 16+ caching — PPR, `use cache` directive, `cacheLife`, `cacheTag`, `updateTag`. Read when adding caching, data fetching boundaries, or optimizing render performance. |
