| **Vercel Composition Patterns** | `.cursor/skills/vercel-composition-patterns/SKILL.md` | Refactoring components with boolean prop proliferation, building flexible component libraries, compound components, or designing reusable APIs. |
| **AI SDK** | `.cursor/skills/ai-sdk/SKILL.md` | Any work involving `generateText`, `streamText`, `ToolLoopAgent`, `embed`, tools, `useChat`, `useCompletion`, or building AI agents, chatbots, RAG, tool calling, structured output. Proposal Studio's LLM layer lives here. |

